sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Provider IPN
    participant P2 as Payments callback
    participant P3 as Signature/reference check
    participant P4 as Payment transaction
    participant P5 as Outbox
    participant P6 as Wallet consumer
    P1->>P2: Receive provider IPN
    P2->>P3: Resolve provider ref
    P3->>P4: Verify sig / amount
    P4->>P5: Commit state + outbox
    P5->>P6: Credit wallet once
    P6-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
